MODEL WEIGHTS
-------------
Trained model weights are downloaded on first use from their authors'
own releases, are stored under stem_cache/, and are not distributed with
Shimmer. Each remains under its author's license:

  htdemucs, htdemucs_ft, htdemucs_6s, hdemucs_mmi
                   Meta Platforms, Inc., released with Demucs (MIT)
                   https://github.com/facebookresearch/demucs
  Mel-Band RoFormer vocal model (vocals_mel_band_roformer.ckpt)
                   Kimberley Jensen, MIT (relicensed from GPL-3.0 on
                   2026-04-22)
                   https://github.com/KimberleyJensen/Mel-Band-Roformer-Vocal-Model

Shimmer only offers models whose license permits use on music that is
released and sold. Models without a published license are not offered.

Optional, used for MP3 / M4A / AAC support:

  ffmpeg           LGPL/GPL         https://ffmpeg.org/

ffmpeg is not distributed with Shimmer; it is located on the user's PATH
at runtime if present.
